Package: ootruncate
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: FILE RESIZER
 Shrinks or extends the length of specified files to exact byte counts.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
